# Requests for the local Functions host (started with F5 or `dotnet run`).
# Visual Studio and VS Code (REST Client) show a "Send request" link above each request.

@FunctionsHost = http://localhost:7071

### Run the timer-triggered function now instead of waiting for the next minute
POST {{FunctionsHost}}/admin/functions/FetchWeather
Content-Type: application/json

{ "input": "" }

### Host status
GET {{FunctionsHost}}/admin/host/status
